# Browser test repository boundary

- `zvenfit-autotests` exclusively owns Playwright, browser E2E specs, configs,
  fixtures, and reusable browser-test workflows.
- Never add Playwright dependencies, configs, or browser E2E source files to
  `zvenfit-frontend`.
- Frontend may contain unit, integration, build, deployment, and static contract
  tests. Its staging workflow only calls the autotests reusable workflow.
- Pin the reusable workflow and `autotests_ref` to the same full commit SHA.
- Change and validate E2E in `zvenfit-autotests` first, then update the frontend
  SHA pin.
- See `AGENTS.md` → “Cross-repository test ownership”.
